   "source": [
    "# 簡介\n",
    "\n",
    "串列是個可儲存多個元素的容器\n",
    "\n",
    "其中元素用逗點隔開，中括號包起來。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "3099cb62",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[78, 29, 56, 80, 99]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "scores=[78,29,56,80,99]\n",
    "print(scores)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6467e615",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 索引值\n",
    "\n",
    "可用來存取串列中元素\n",
    "\n",
    "注意：由0開始\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "8bb2657b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "78\n",
      "29\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(scores[0])\n",
    "print(scores[1])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "79390b48",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 串列內容個數\n",
    "\n",
    "len(a) 取得a串列中元素個數"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "61c170bf",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "5\n",
      "99\n",
      "99\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(len(scores))\n",
    "print(scores[len(scores)-1])\n",
    "print(scores[-1])"
   ]
  }
